Akbar hai karbala me teri aaqri azaa'n<br>
rone lagi zameen ye rota hai aasmaa'n<br>
<br>
Ashoor ka ye waqt hai kohraam hai bapa<br>
sunkar teri azaan ko roti hai syeda<br>
tooti kamar ko thaam ke sheh karte hai bayaa'n<br>
<br>
Naize ki nok seene me paiwast hoyegi<br>
zainab udaake khaak ko jee bhar ke royegi<br>
rukti nahi hai duqtare sarwar ki hichkiyaa'n<br>
<br>
<br>
Aayi hai jo madine se Ahmad ki sawari<br>
rote hai nabi sunke jo ek maa ki duhayi<br>
tum par nabi ka dil hua qurbaan meri jaa'n<br>
<br>
Hum shakle mustafa ho tum sughra ka chain ho<br>
aur karbala me jaane shahe mashraqain ho<br>
sar peet ti hai qaime me roti hai teri maa<br>
<br>
labbaik keh rahe hain farishte azaan par<br>
kaisi udaasi chaayi hai wo aasmaan par<br>
waqte saher ye kehta hai besheer o bezabaa'n<br>
<br>
Akbar akela mujhko nahi chord jao tum<br>
milwau'n sakina se tumhe paas aao tum<br>
behosh ho chuki hai wo ro ro ke meri jaa'n<br>
<br>
Akbar ye nouha ibnee ali karte hain buka<br>
Afsar sunao kya mai jafaou'n ka silsila<br>
karti hai yaad bhai ko sughra ki duriyaa'n
